          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses answered the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", “But suppose the Israelites do not believe me and will not listen to what I say. What shall I do if they say that you did not appear to me?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
