          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Throw it on the ground.” When Moses threw it down, it turned into a snake, and he ran away from it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Bend down and pick it up by the tail.” So Moses bent down and caught it, and it became a stick again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Do this to prove to the Israelites that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of their ancestors, the God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, has appeared to you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
