          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to Moses again, “Put your hand inside your robe.” Moses obeyed; and when he took his hand out, it was diseased, covered with white spots, like snow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Put your hand inside your robe again.” He did so, and when he took it out this time, it was healthy, just like the rest of his body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “If they will not believe you or be convinced by the first miracle, then this one will convince them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If in spite of these two miracles they still will not believe you, and if they refuse to listen to what you say, take some water from the Nile and pour it on the ground. The water will turn into blood.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
