        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Who gives man his mouth? Who makes him deaf or dumb? Who gives him sight or makes him blind? It is I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, go! I will help you to speak, and I will tell you what to say.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
