          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " became angry with Moses and said, “What about your brother Aaron, the Levite? I know that he can speak well. In fact, he is now coming to meet you and will be glad to see you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can speak to him and tell him what to say. I will help both of you to speak, and I will tell you both what to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will be your spokesman and speak to the people for you. Then you will be like God, telling him what to say. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take this stick with you; for with it you will perform miracles.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
