        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses went back to Jethro, his father-in-law, and said to him, “Please let me go back to my relatives in Egypt to see if they are still alive.” Jethro agreed and said goodbye to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Moses was still in Midian, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Go back to Egypt, for all those who wanted to kill you are dead.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses took his wife and his sons, put them on a donkey, and set out with them for Egypt, carrying the stick that God had told him to take.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
