          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Now that you are going back to Egypt, be sure to perform before the king all the miracles which I have given you the power to do. But I will make the king stubborn, and he will not let the people go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you must tell him that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", say, ‘Israel is my firstborn son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 12.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I told you to let my son go, so that he might worship me, but you refused. Now I am going to kill your firstborn son.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
