          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At a camping place on the way to Egypt, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " met Moses and tried to kill him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Zipporah, his wife, took a sharp stone, cut off the foreskin of her son, and touched Moses' feet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.25+EXO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.25",
              "EXO.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
