          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses told Aaron everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had said when he told him to return to Egypt; he also told him about the miracles which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had ordered him to perform. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses and Aaron went to Egypt and gathered all the Israelite leaders together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaron told them everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had said to Moses, and then Moses performed all the miracles in front of the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
