          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They believed, and when they heard that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had come to them and had seen how they were being treated cruelly, they bowed down and worshipped.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
